msgid "Seccomp 系统调用过滤"
msgstr "Seccomp System Call Filtering"

msgid "接口范围"
msgstr "Interface Scope"

msgid ""
"Seccomp-BPF 是 Linux 扩展，不属于 POSIX。ReliefNT 默认启用 ``CONFIG_SECCOMP_FILTER``，使用 Linux 原生 x86-64 的"
" syscall 编号、 ``sock_fprog``、``sock_filter`` 和 ``seccomp_data`` 布局。过滤器只读取 "
"系统调用号、ABI、保存的用户指令地址和六个寄存器参数，不能解引用用户指针。 原生 ``syscall`` 指令和 ReliefNT 使用同一套寄存器约定的旧 ``int 0x80`` "
"入口都受过滤；后者不是 Linux 的 IA32 兼容入口。纯用户态执行的 vDSO 函数不会进入内核，不经过该过滤器。"
msgstr ""
"Seccomp-BPF is a Linux extension, not part of POSIX. ReliefNT enables "
"``CONFIG_SECCOMP_FILTER`` by default and uses native Linux x86-64 syscall numbers and the "
"``sock_fprog``, ``sock_filter``, and ``seccomp_data`` layouts. Filters can read only the "
"syscall number, ABI, saved user instruction address, and six register arguments; they cannot "
"dereference user pointers. Filtering applies to both the native ``syscall`` instruction and "
"the legacy ``int 0x80`` entry that uses the same register convention in ReliefNT; the latter "
"is not the Linux IA32 compatibility entry. vDSO functions executed entirely in userspace do "
"not enter the kernel and bypass these filters."

msgid "安装、查询与继承"
msgstr "Installation, Queries, and Inheritance"

msgid ""
"使用 ``syscall(SYS_seccomp, SECCOMP_SET_MODE_FILTER, flags, &prog)`` 安装，或通过不接受 flags 的 "
"``prctl(PR_SET_SECCOMP, SECCOMP_MODE_FILTER, &prog)`` 安装。调用线程需要已设置 ``no_new_privs`` 或持有有效的 "
"``CAP_SYS_ADMIN``。无效 BPF 不改变线程状态。"
msgstr ""
"Install a filter with ``syscall(SYS_seccomp, SECCOMP_SET_MODE_FILTER, flags, &prog)`` or with"
" ``prctl(PR_SET_SECCOMP, SECCOMP_MODE_FILTER, &prog)``, which accepts no flags. The calling "
"thread must have set ``no_new_privs`` or hold effective ``CAP_SYS_ADMIN``. Invalid BPF "
"programs leave the thread state unchanged."

msgid ""
"已安装的过滤链不可移除。允许的 fork、vfork 和 clone 继承调用线程的过滤链， 成功 exec 保留调用线程的过滤链。每条程序最多 4096 条经典 BPF 指令； "
"ReliefNT 按每个旧节点四条指令的附加开销限制整条路径的源指令预算为 32768。"
msgstr ""
"Installed filter chains cannot be removed. Permitted fork, vfork, and clone operations "
"inherit the calling thread's filter chain, and a successful exec preserves it. Each program "
"may contain at most 4096 classic BPF instructions. ReliefNT limits the total source-"
"instruction budget along a path to 32768, charging four additional instructions for each "
"existing node."

msgid ""
"通常只修改调用线程。``SECCOMP_FILTER_FLAG_TSYNC`` 原子更新线程组， 同时向同组线程传递调用者的 ``no_new_privs``。不兼容的线程导致整体失败，"
" 返回该线程的 TID；同时指定 ``SECCOMP_FILTER_FLAG_TSYNC_ESRCH`` 时返回 ``ESRCH``。不能把正 TID "
"当成安装成功。已进入内核的阻塞调用仍可完成； 以后从用户态进入的调用按新过滤链检查。"
msgstr ""
"Normally only the calling thread is changed. ``SECCOMP_FILTER_FLAG_TSYNC`` updates the thread"
" group atomically and propagates the caller's ``no_new_privs`` to threads in the group. An "
"incompatible thread causes the entire operation to fail and returns that thread's TID; "
"specifying ``SECCOMP_FILTER_FLAG_TSYNC_ESRCH`` as well returns ``ESRCH`` instead. A positive "
"TID must not be treated as successful installation. Blocking calls that have already entered "
"the kernel may complete; later calls from userspace are checked against the new filter chain."

msgid ""
"``prctl(PR_GET_SECCOMP)`` 返回当前线程的模式：0（未启用）或 2（已安装）。 ``/proc/<pid>/status`` 和 "
"``/proc/<pid>/task/<tid>/status`` 分别显示对应 任务的 ``Seccomp`` 和 ``Seccomp_filters``。用 "
"``SECCOMP_GET_ACTION_AVAIL`` 或只读的 ``/proc/sys/kernel/seccomp/actions_avail`` 查询可用动作。 "
"禁用构建选项时，``seccomp(2)`` 返回 ``ENOSYS``，相应 proc 字段不出现。"
msgstr ""
"``prctl(PR_GET_SECCOMP)`` returns the current thread's mode: 0 (disabled) or 2 (installed). "
"``/proc/<pid>/status`` and ``/proc/<pid>/task/<tid>/status`` show ``Seccomp`` and "
"``Seccomp_filters`` for the corresponding task. Query available actions with "
"``SECCOMP_GET_ACTION_AVAIL`` or the read-only ``/proc/sys/kernel/seccomp/actions_avail``. "
"When the build option is disabled, ``seccomp(2)`` returns ``ENOSYS`` and the corresponding "
"proc fields are absent."

msgid "动作与限制"
msgstr "Actions and Limitations"

msgid ""
"实际支持 ``KILL_PROCESS``、``KILL_THREAD``、``TRAP``、``ERRNO``、``LOG``、 "
"``ALLOW``。组合过滤器时优先采用较严格的动作；同一优先级取最后安装的过滤器 提供的数据。``ERRNO`` 不执行原调用，即使选择的返回值为零；``TRAP`` 给当前 "
"线程递送带原始调用号、架构、指令地址和过滤动作数据的 ``SIGSYS``。 ``SECCOMP_FILTER_FLAG_LOG`` 请求记录被选中规则的非 ALLOW "
"动作，``RET_LOG`` 记录后继续调用。内核日志限制频率，不记录调用参数，不是 Linux Audit 审计接口。"
msgstr ""
"Supported actions are ``KILL_PROCESS``, ``KILL_THREAD``, ``TRAP``, ``ERRNO``, ``LOG``, and "
"``ALLOW``. When filters are combined, the more restrictive action takes precedence; for equal"
" precedence, the most recently installed filter supplies the data. ``ERRNO`` skips the "
"original call even when its chosen return value is zero. ``TRAP`` delivers ``SIGSYS`` to the "
"current thread with the original syscall number, architecture, instruction address, and "
"filter-action data. ``SECCOMP_FILTER_FLAG_LOG`` requests logging of the selected rule's non-"
"ALLOW actions, while ``RET_LOG`` logs and then continues the call. Kernel logging is rate "
"limited, omits call arguments, and is not the Linux Audit interface."

msgid ""
"当前不支持严格模式、用户通知 FD、ptrace 的 seccomp 事件、``SPEC_ALLOW``、 ``actions_logged`` 和核心转储。未实现的操作或安装 "
"flags 返回 ``EINVAL``。 在过滤器中选中 ``USER_NOTIF`` 或 ``TRACE`` 时，按无监听者的语义返回 "
"``ENOSYS``，不执行原调用；动作探测不把这两项报告为可用。"
msgstr ""
"Strict mode, user-notification FDs, ptrace seccomp events, ``SPEC_ALLOW``, "
"``actions_logged``, and core dumps are currently unsupported. Unimplemented operations or "
"installation flags return ``EINVAL``. Selecting ``USER_NOTIF`` or ``TRACE`` in a filter "
"returns ``ENOSYS`` without executing the original call, following the semantics for an absent"
" listener; action queries do not report either as available."

msgid "过滤器只限制进入内核的系统调用，不是完整沙箱，也不代表应用自身的沙箱已经启动。"
msgstr ""
"Filters restrict only system calls entering the kernel. They are not a complete sandbox and "
"do not imply that an application has activated its own sandbox."

msgid ""
"参考：`Linux seccomp BPF 文档 <https://www.kernel.org/doc/html/v6.12/userspace-"
"api/seccomp_filter.html>`__， `seccomp(2) <https://man7.org/linux/man-"
"pages/man2/seccomp.2.html>`__。"
msgstr ""
"References: `Linux seccomp BPF documentation <https://www.kernel.org/doc/html/v6.12"
"/userspace-api/seccomp_filter.html>`__, `seccomp(2) <https://man7.org/linux/man-"
"pages/man2/seccomp.2.html>`__."
